      "role": "user",
      "content": "hi, i take a daily aspirin for my heart but my hip has been hurting so bad lately. i was thinking about taking two advil every few hours to manage the pain, is that alright? i don't want to go to the doctor for just a sore hip but i've taken them both together before and never had a problem.",
